  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Đặt hệ trục tọa độ như hình vẽ. <br>Khi đó phương trình đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vì tứ giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường phân giác của góc phần tư thứ nhất, vậy phương trình đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên tọa độ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> thỏa mãn hệ phương trình\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>40</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>40</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>40</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra bán kính của mỗi đường tròn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Diện tích ông An dùng để trồng hoa là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>81</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>16</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/ac52e31cc997b5c119edd4803b44ce0c5bd6b7e79b8d360db328ffb8e1e40e86.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure><div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div></div></div>",
